@RameshVelliathiam  This was an answer to a person who said ARR COMPOSED FOR PUNNAGAI MANNAN  BY


@BC999 
vor 1 Jahr 
Arr could only dream of composing such a gorgeous melody / BGM.  Even from Arr's words: 'I was only an OPERATOR'.  ILAYARAJA INTRODUCED COMPUTER MUSIC and Synthesizer in INDIA through Vikram and Punnagai Mannan albums (1986), when he bought a computer from his Singapore trip and wanted an operator which Arr fulfilled, with the assistance of Puru and Viji Manuel.  HOW LONG will you Arr fans keep uttering the same fallacy (your WA group theories!) over and over again desperately trying to make it a fact?!  This is how your ilk spreads disinformation.  BC 999 IS AN INDIAN LADY PROBABLY LIVING IN UK, HOLDS Ph.D IN CHEMISTRY & MASTERED COMPUTER TECHNOLOGY. I
